OL,3,GNEWSAPolice car set alight in Glasgow
OL,4,Aamid Bonfire Night trouble
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have been arrested during
OL,7,FBonfire Night disorder in parts of
OL,8,FScotland, police say.
OL,10,FA police officer and an ambulance staff
OL,11,Fmember sustained minor injuries when
OL,12,Fthey were attacked with fireworks while
OL,13,Fresponding to a report of an injured
OL,14,Fman in Glasgow, according to Police
OL,15,FScotland.
OL,17,FA police vehicle was set alight and
OL,18,Fseriously damaged during the incident
OL,19,Fin the Greenside Street area, and a
OL,20,F16-year-old boy was arrested.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
